%% title: Document Render & Sign Flow
sequenceDiagram
    actor Caller as Operator / Service
    participant DR as DocumentResource
    participant RS as DocumentRenderService
    participant TR as TemplateRenderPort
    participant PDF as PdfRenderPort
    participant OS as ObjectStorePort
    participant DB as PostgreSQL (documents + outbox)
    participant K as Kafka (documents.document.event)
    participant SR as SignatureCeremonyResource
    participant CS as SignatureCeremonyService
    participant SEAL as SignatureSealPort

    Caller->>DR: POST /api/v1/documents/render
    DR->>RS: render(cmd)
    RS->>DB: findPublished(code, version)
    RS->>TR: renderHtml(template, data)
    RS->>PDF: htmlToPdf(html)
    RS->>OS: put(storageKey, pdf, contentType)
    RS->>DB: saveWithOutbox(document, DocumentGenerated)
    DB-->>K: (outbox dispatcher) document.generated.v1
    DR-->>Caller: 201 DocumentResponse (sha256, storageKey)

    Caller->>SR: POST /api/v1/signature-ceremonies
    SR->>CS: openCeremony(documentId, signers)
    CS->>DB: save(ceremony PENDING)
    Caller->>SR: POST /{id}/decisions (SIGNED)
    SR->>CS: recordDecision(id, party, SIGNED)
    CS->>SEAL: sealPades(pdf, ceremony)  %% phase-1 no-op
    CS->>OS: put(storageKey, sealedPdf)
    CS->>DB: saveWithOutbox(ceremony COMPLETED, SignatureCeremonyCompleted)
    DB-->>K: signature-ceremony.completed.v1
